# Regulamin ↔ app logic sync

Public legal copy lives in `src/constants/legalMarkdown.ts` (`DEFAULT_REGULAMIN_MD`, privacy, cookies). Firestore CMS (`regulamin/content`, etc.) is seeded/fallback from those strings; admin can overwrite. **Product facts must stay true in the defaults** — lawyers may edit CMS wording later, but agents must not leave defaults that contradict code.

## When you change product behaviour

If the change affects any of the topics below, **update `DEFAULT_REGULAMIN_MD` in the same task** (and privacy/cookies defaults when processing/cookies change). Bump `EFFECTIVE_FROM` in `legalMarkdown.ts` when the published rules change.

| Topic | Code anchors | Regulamin sections (typical) |
|-------|--------------|------------------------------|
| Enroll / capacity / canceled / inactive | `functions/src/enrollment.ts`, `/api/enroll` | V zapis |
| Unenroll (who, when) | `/api/unenroll` | VIII rezygnacja |
| Waitlist (course-level, guest e-mail, no auto-seat) | `courseWaitingList.ts` | V lista oczekujących |
| Prices / VAT / proforma due (date − 5 days) | `pricing.ts`, `proformaInvoices.ts`, `proformaDue.ts` | VI płatności |
| Paid / cash only via admin | `courses.ts` toggles | VI |
| Registration fields / terms checkbox | `schemas.ts`, `RegisterView` | IV konto |
| Auth methods (e-mail, Google, magic link) | `auth.ts` | IV |
| Course gear/permit requirements UX | course description `requirements` | VII |
| Billing identity (NIP, address, bank) | `billingData.ts` FALLBACK | I, VI |
| Cookies / analytics | cookie banner, Firebase Analytics | cookies + privacy |

## Rules of drafting

- Mirror **what the app actually does**. Do not invent automatic refunds, payment gateways, age checks, or FIFO waitlist assignment unless implemented.
- Policy that is legal-only (e.g. refund % by day, art. 38 odstąpienie) may stay as drafted defaults — label remains “draft for lawyer review” in the file header.
- After editing defaults: remind that **already published** Firestore content is not overwritten until admin uses „Przywróć domyślny” + Zapisz (or manual edit).
- Cross-link privacy/cookies URLs when changing those docs too.

## Do not

- Skip updating `legalMarkdown.ts` because “CMS already has text”.
- Put live secrets or full IBAN in UI copy beyond what proforma/billing already exposes.
- Soften safety/permit obligations when adding softer product UX.
